-standard security measures to protect your personal data.</li><li>Payment transactions are encrypted and handled by secure third-party providers.</li><li>We do not sell, rent, or share your information with third parties for marketing purposes.</li></ul><p><strong>4. Cookies &amp; Tracking Technologies</strong></p><ul><li>We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience and analyze website traffic.</li><li>You can manage cookie preferences through your browser settings.</li></ul><p><strong>5. Third-Party Services</strong></p><p>We may share necessary data with:</p><ul><li>Payment processors (Klarna, PayPal, Stripe) for secure transactions.</li><li>Shipping carriers for order delivery.</li><li>Analytics providers (Google Analytics) to improve website performance.</li></ul><p><strong>6. Your Rights &amp; Choices</strong></p><ul><li>Access &amp; Updates: You can request access to or updates to your personal data.</li><li>Opt-Out: Unsubscribe from marketing emails at any time.</li><li>Data Deletion: Request the removal of your personal information unless required by law.</li></ul><p><strong>7. Changes to This Policy</strong></p><p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with the revised effective date.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>8. Contact Us</strong></p><p>For any privacy-related questions or requests, contact us at:<br>📧 <strong>[Insert Contact Email]</strong></p>"}],
